###  https://www.easi.uni-bayreuth.de/crossnfi#AngleCount
:AngleCount rdf:type owl:Class ;
            rdfs:subClassOf :Quantity ;
            skos:definition "number of trees counted in an angle count sample"@de ;
            skos:note """Instances are related by ´qudt:hasUnit' to a ´qudt:Unit´, which ´qudt:hasQuantityKind´ ´quantitkind:Count´. This usually is ´unit:COUNT´

Thes counts usually are diiferentiated by tree spescies to which this quantity realtes to by the property  ´ofSpecies´ 

TODO: It would be better to integrate the count of a certain basal area factor as unit in QUDT."""@en ;
            skos:prefLabel "Winkelanzahl"@de ,
                           "angle count"@en ,
                           "conteo angular relascópico"@es .


###  https://www.easi.uni-bayreuth.de/crossnfi#AngleCountOfBasalAreaFactor1m2
:AngleCountOfBasalAreaFactor1m2 rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                rdfs:subClassOf :AngleCount ;
                                rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.easi.uni-bayreuth.de/crossnfi> ;
                                rdfs:label "angle count of basal area factor 1 m²"@en ;
                                skos:definition "number of trees counted in an angle count sample of basal area factor 1 m²"@en ;
                                skos:note """Instances are related by ´qudt:hasUnit' to a ´qudt:Unit´, which ´qudt:hasQuantityKind´ ´quantitkind:Count´. This usually is ´unit:COUNT´

Thes counts usually are diiferentiated by tree spescies to which this quantity realtes to by the property  ´ofSpecies´ 

TODO: It would be better to integrate the count of a certain basal area factor as unit in QUDT."""@en ;
                                skos:prefLabel "Winkelanzahl mit Zählfaktor 4 m²"@de ,
                                               "conteo angular relascópico de factor de proporcionalidad de 4 m²"@es .


###  https://www.easi.uni-bayreuth.de/crossnfi#AngleCountOfBasalAreaFactor2m2
:AngleCountOfBasalAreaFactor2m2 rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                rdfs:subClassOf :AngleCount ;
                                rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.easi.uni-bayreuth.de/crossnfi> ;
                                skos:definition "number of trees counted in an angle count sample of basal area factor 4 m²"@en ;
                                skos:note """Instances are related by ´qudt:hasUnit' to a ´qudt:Unit´, which ´qudt:hasQuantityKind´ ´quantitkind:Count´. This usually is ´unit:COUNT´

Thes counts usually are diiferentiated by tree spescies to which this quantity realtes to by the property  ´ofSpecies´ 

TODO: It would be better to integrate the count of a certain basal area factor as unit in QUDT."""@en ;
                                skos:prefLabel "Winkelanzahl mit Zählfaktor 4 m²"@de ,
                                               "angle count of basal area factor 2 m²"@en ,
                                               "conteo angular relascópico de factor de proporcionalidad de 4 m²"@es .


###  https://www.easi.uni-bayreuth.de/crossnfi#AngleCountOfBasalAreaFactor4m2
:AngleCountOfBasalAreaFactor4m2 rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                rdfs:subClassOf :AngleCount ;
                                rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.easi.uni-bayreuth.de/crossnfi> ;
                                rdfs:label "angle count of basal area factor 4 m²"@en ;
                                skos:definition "number of trees counted in an angle count sample of basal area factor 4 m²"@en ;
                                skos:note """Instances are related by ´qudt:hasUnit' to a ´qudt:Unit´, which ´qudt:hasQuantityKind´ ´quantitkind:Count´. This usually is ´unit:COUNT´

Thes counts usually are diiferentiated by tree spescies to which this quantity realtes to by the property  ´ofSpecies´ 

TODO: It would be better to integrate the count of a certain basal area factor as unit in QUDT."""@en ;
                                skos:prefLabel "Winkelanzahl mit Zählfaktor 4 m²"@de ,
                                               "conteo angular relascópico de factor de proporcionalidad de 4 m²"@es .


###  https://www.easi.uni-bayreuth.de/crossnfi#AngleCountSample
:AngleCountSample rdf:type owl:Class ;
                  rdfs:subClassOf :SampleOfTreesOfMinDiameter ;
                  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.easi.uni-bayreuth.de/crossnfi> ;
                  skos:definition "A set of trees that is assigned to a central point by satisfying a certain diameter-distance requiremement. An Angle Count Sample is attributed by a basal area factor (BAF). A tree belongs to the Angle Count Sample, if and only if the relation of its diameter at breast height (in cm)  to its distance to the central point (in m) surpasses a minimum relation constant,  which corresponds to the basal area factor (eg. BAF 4 m² has the relation of ¹/₂₅)"@en ;
                  skos:note """Often the trees in the sample are not rerred to individually but just counted, most often distuished by species. A count is refered to by the property 'cnfi:hasCount' and notes the corresponding species. For some angle count samples though the individual trees are recorded.

The count of trees in an angle count sample is in a statistical relationship with the basal area of a fixed sample circle with the same central point and is thus used as an approximation to the basal area. The counting factor corresponds to the base area in m² added by a single tree falling into the angle count sample. The counting factors of 1 m², 2 m² and 4 m² are common.

Forest and Stand borders in the sample tree's and/or central point's vicinity are used for the reflection computation. This is a computational procedure, which reflects the sample tree's base areas on the aforementioned borders. Would the diameter of such a reflected tree  in combination with the refleæction's distance to the central point sufficeto fall into the ideal sample circle, then the preimage tree is counted twice in the sample."""@en ;
                  skos:prefLabel "Winkelzählprobe"@de ,
                                 "angle count sample"@en ,
                                 "muestra angular relascópica"@es .


###  https://www.easi.uni-bayreuth.de/crossnfi#Area
:Area rdf:type owl:Class ;
      rdfs:subClassOf :Quantity ;
      rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.easi.uni-bayreuth.de/crossnfi> ;
      skos:definition "Area is the measure of a region's size on a surface."@en ;
      skos:note "In colloquial speach area can also have the same meaning as region. In the compound terms like 'forest area' and similar it has this meaning and these terms are established.  A compound term like 'forest region' would imply a different meaning in colloquial language than intended"@en ,
                "instances are related by ´qudt:hasUnit' to a ´qudt:Unit´, which ´qudt:hasQuantityKind´ ´qudt:Area´.  Usually this is  ´unit:HA´ or ´unit:AC´."@en ;
      skos:prefLabel "Fläche"@de ,
                     "area"@en ,
                     "área"@es .


