         skos:note "instances are related by ´qudt:hasUnit' to a ´qudt:Unit´, which ´qudt:hasQuantityKind´ ´qudt:Angle´. This usually is ´unit:DEG´ or ´unit:GON´" ;
         skos:prefLabel "Azimuth"@de ,
                        "acimut"@es ,
                        "azimuth"@en .


###  https://www.easi.uni-bayreuth.de/crossnfi#Badlands
:Badlands rdf:type owl:Class ;
