            skos:note """For the German BWI and the Spanish IFN the border value is at 20 cm, for the US FIA it lies at 9 in = 22.86 cm for softwoods (conifers) and woodland trees and at 11 in = 27.94 cm for hardwoods

The Spanish IFN and the US FIA have  a finer classification, but the German BWI uses this broad class"""@en ,
                      "Jungbestand"@de ,
