             rdfs:isDefinedBy "https://www.easi.uni-bayreuth.de/crossnfi"@en ;
             skos:definition "the plot area is not valid"@en ;
             skos:note """possible reasons are
- its hypothetical location corresponds to the pattern of a cluster or grit, but is situated in non-inventory area or an area with a different sampling density. 
